# Supply-chain attack report — {{ today }}

Generated by the `security-scan` skill. **This report is distinct from
`REPORT.md`** (CVE/GHSA findings in legitimate code). Supply-chain
attacks (intentionally-malicious package publishes) bypass CVSS, use
your own install scripts as the delivery vector, and frequently ship
destructive secondary payloads (dead-man switches, credential theft).

**Treat every exact match here as CRITICAL** until reviewed.

